    "turn_text": "Our guest today is Congressman Chris Stewart. He was elected in 2012 and represents Utah. Congressman, how are you? I'm very good. It's good to spend some time with you. Thank you. Well, thank you so much for joining us. Hey, as I just mentioned, you're elected in 2012. You have a successful business career. You've been in the military. I'm curious, why did you choose to run for public office?",
