    "turn_text": "That's good to know. I think the public, I certainly didn't know that. And it's interesting to see that. It seems like there's a lot of time that's not spent on the floor, and there's a lot of work. In fact, someone most of the work is not done on the floor of the house, but instead, talking with constituents and so on.",
