    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90236.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 30,
    "turn_text": "Wow, that is a great question. It's kind of like asking which one of your children is your favorite, right? It depends on the day maybe. And of course, you love them all. And it's really hard to select just one thing. So I'm going to cheat and say two. One of them would be, as I said, control our debt. We just can't spend ourselves into a Bolivian like we've done in the last few years. It will hurt. And in fact, it already is hurting American people. It hurts workers. It hurts hard-working families. We have to be able to control that. But the second thing I would do actually ties with it closely, and that is just the power and the destructive nature of the regulatory agencies.",
